    "text": {
      "en": "DMI's Bornholm radar sits on a former military tower on Rytterknægten, the island's highest point at 162 m, in the Almindingen forest. A radar has watched the Baltic Sea from here since 2007; after repeated breakdowns it was replaced by a new Vaisala radar in 2023."
