    "towerM": null,
    "text": {
      "en": "This DMI radar stands at Juvre on Rømø, a Wadden Sea island off south-west Jutland, and watches the German Bight and western Denmark. A radar has worked here since 1992; the current dual-polarisation unit was installed in 2017 as part of the renewal of the Danish network."
