    "towerM": null,
    "text": {
      "en": "This DMI radar stands at Mandehoved on the Stevns peninsula, next to a viewing tower near the chalk cliffs of Stevns Klint, a UNESCO World Heritage site. It covers Zealand, Copenhagen and the western Baltic; the current dual-polarisation radar replaced the earlier one in October 2017."
